op(400, infix, "*").
formulas(assumptions).
X*X = X.
(Y*X)*X = Y*X.
(X*Y)*X = Y*X.
((Z*X)*Y)*X = Z*(Y*X).
(((Z*X)*Y)*X)*Y = (Z*X)*Y.
